# Everything here is fetched or derived and is regenerated by the scripts, so none of it
# ships -- with one deliberate exception.
*
!.gitignore

# The EPA register publishes at a dated path and overwrites the listing. Only the current
# edition resolves; September 2021 returns 404 and no web archive holds it. These two are
# committed under the repo's stated exception for a snapshot that cannot be reconstructed.
# Without the 2021 edition there is one edition, no interval, and the recipe's central
# finding cannot be computed. 756 KB each.
!lmop-2021-09.xlsx
!lmop-2024-09.xlsx
